      757             VIEW-AS FILL-IN
      758             SIZE 21 BY 1
      759             FGCOLOR 4
      760        BR-lines AT ROW 8 COL 1
      761        tt-c-fin-statement.PS AT ROW 20 COL 1 NO-LABEL
      762             VIEW-AS EDITOR SCROLLBAR-VERTICAL
      763             SIZE 98 BY 2 TOOLTIP "Дополнительная информация"
      764       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      765            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      766            CANCEL-BUTTON B-quit.
      767   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      768        mark-num AT ROW 1 COL 30.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
